    "id": "2122",
    "timezone": "3"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「えへ。楽しいなぁ、転校生しゃん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「おら、いつもひとりで買い物してるがらなぁ。つばさしゃん、そういうの付きあってぐれねぇし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「たまに一緒に行っても、芸能人御用達の高級店とかでな～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「素性がばれたら騒ぎになるがらっで、つばさしゃんに言われて変装させられるし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「そんな気にしなくても、おらなんか知名度ないと思うげどなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「えっ、さっきも騒ぎになってた？　あぁ、何だが『人だかり』ができてたなぁ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「交通事故でもあったんじゃねぇが、それが転校生しゃんがイケメンだからどが♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「えへ。おら、はしゃぎすぎがな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「しかしまぁ……近所にこんな、でっけぇショッピングモールがあったんだなぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「地元なのに、知らないこと『いっぱい』だぁ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「憧れの大都会って感じだぁ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「このショッピングモールだげで、おらの『ふるさと』の島より店の数がおおいかも～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「いろんなものが売ってて、目移りしちまうなぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「いけないいけない、今日は買い物しにきたんじゃねぇのに」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「あっ、でも。あの服とか、つばさしゃんに似合いそう♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「……おわっとと？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「すんましぇん、転校生しゃん。転びそうになって、思わずしがみついちまっただ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「うん、しっがり支えてぐれだがら怪我はねぇだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "（頼もしいなぁ、転校生しゃん。男のひとだなぁ、ちから強ぇんだ。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "（何だが、故郷のお父を思いだしちまうなぁ……♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "（懐かしいなぁ、もうずいぶん故郷に帰ってねぇだ。みんな元気でやってるがなぁ。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "（ライブチケットとかは送ってるげど、島は遠いがらなぁ……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "（あぁ、何だかホームシックになってきちまっただ。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "（毎日、忙しくて『それどころ』じゃねぇし。つばさしゃんがいるから、寂しさを忘れられてるげど）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "（見知らぬ大都会で、初めてのことばっかりのアイドルのお仕事に忙殺されて。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "（忘れちまいそうだ。こういう、あったかい感じ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "（今日は、転校生しゃんに甘えちまおうがな？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "（いいよなぁ、同じクラスの子とがもそうしてるし……。おらだって、君咲学院の後輩だぁ♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "set_still_image",
    "id": "card/normal/1072"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "（えへ。このまま、腕組んだまま歩いちまおっと。ぎゅう～☆）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "remove_still_image"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「そういえば、転校生しゃん。おらたち、これから何処に向かえばいいんだろ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「もうじき、約束の時間になっちまうなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「遅刻しねぇように、しねぇとな。こっちが無理を言って、頼みごとをするわげだし」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「うん。前にも説明したけど……アルバイトがしてぇんだ、ちょっと入り用でなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「いやいや、アイドルのお仕事でも稼いではいるげど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「仕事の報酬どがは、おらとつばさしゃんの共用の口座に振りこまれるがら」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「ソロで仕事する機会もねぇしなぁ、今んとご。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「報酬も個人じゃなぐでメリメロ名義で支払われるがら、ＣＤとがの印税もぜんぶ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「アイドルとしての稼ぎは、おらの自由にできないお金なんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「生活費とがは、その共用の口座から出してるげどな」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「そもそも。おらがアイドルとして活動できてるのはぜんぶ、つばさしゃんのお陰だぁ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「だがらアイドルとしての成果も報酬もぜんぶ、つばさしゃんが受け取るべきなんだぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「おらは、そう思っでるがら」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「おらはアイドルとして、つばさしゃんのそばにいられるだけで、これ以上ねぇぐらいの果報者なんだぁ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「んでも、学校生活でも何かと自分用の出費があるしなぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「筆記用具とが、あとチア部の活動で遠征するときの交通費とが」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「……いつも世話になっでる、つばさしゃんにプレゼントもしてぇしな。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「もうじき、つばさしゃんが芸能界デビューして十周年なんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「祝ってやりてぇんだ。できれば、おら自身が、おらだけのちからで稼いだお金で」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「だがら、バイトするんだぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「アイドルとして仕事を得るのは、その稼ぎからプレゼント～ってのは、ちょっと『ちがう』って思うがら」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「『merry-melodyの花音ことり』は、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「つばさしゃんが見つけて大事に育てて愛してくれて、このかたちにつくってくれた偶像だぁ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「それは、おらだけど、おらじゃない。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「うまく言えないけど……。おらは、つばさしゃんのことが大好きな、おら自身でつばさしゃんを祝いたい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「むかし、テレビ画面のなかで輝いてた……。おらの憧れだった世界でいちばん大好きな、つばさしゃんに」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「十年間お疲れさま、大好きだよって、おら自身のぜんぶで伝えたい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「そのために。何にもできねぇ、おらだげど……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「働きたい、お金を稼ぎたい。自分自身の手のひらで掴んだものを、つばさしゃんに捧げたい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「わかってぐれるがなぁ、転校生しゃん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「うひゃっ、そんなに勢いよく歩いたら転んじまうだよ。腕を組んでるんだがら……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「『じゃあ、急がなくちゃ』ってことだが？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
